+                     0 |||:|||. 8
+   query             0 GATYACAC 8
+   <BLANKLINE>
+
+
+Instead of the substitution matrix, you can also use a ``PairwiseAligner``
+object (see Chapter :ref:`chapter:pairwise`) as the ``scoring`` argument
+to use the substitution matrix associated with the aligner.
